## 1. Channel foundation

**Niche test (score 1-5 each, keep 16+):** Interest (can I do this 2 years?), Demand (do people search/watch it?), Money (affiliate, services, memberships, sponsors?), Edge (my experience, voice, format).

**Positioning statement:** I help [specific viewer] achieve [specific result] through [format], so they can [bigger benefit].

**2026 rules for a new channel**
- Make every video from your own script, footage or analysis.
- No AI presenters on health, money or legal topics.
- Use AI as a tool, not a replacement for your point of view.

**Setup checklist**
- [ ] Google account with 2-Step Verification
- [ ] Channel name and matching @handle
- [ ] Verify phone (videos over 15 min, custom thumbnails)
- [ ] Turn on advanced features in Studio
- [ ] Country, language, default upload settings
- [ ] About section, channel keywords, links, business email
- [ ] Start AdSense setup early

**Branding specs:** profile 800x800; banner 2560x1440 (safe area about 1546x423); watermark 150x150; thumbnail 1280x720. Pick 2 colors, 1-2 fonts, one thumbnail style.

