## 3. Script

| Part | Time | Job |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Hook | 0-15 s | Promise or problem plus curiosity |
| Context | 15-40 s | Why for them, why you |
| Body | chapters of 60-120 s | One sub-question each |
| Re-hooks | every 60-90 s | Reset attention |
| Payoff | last 30-60 s | Deliver the promise |
| Next step | last 10 s | Send to a related video |

**Hook formulas:** result first; problem and stakes; curiosity gap; story open; challenge. Hook must match title and thumbnail.

**Retention rules:** cut the greeting; one idea per video; write for the ear; change something every 5-10 s; open loops; show proof; cut filler.

**Shorts (15-45 s):** 0-2 s stops the swipe; one idea, fast cuts, on-screen text; end with payoff or a loop. Original footage/script only. Consider numbered series.

**AI for scripts:** brainstorm and tighten only; add your experience; fact-check; never swap the topic in a template.

```
TITLE / THUMBNAIL IDEA / VIEWER / PROMISE
HOOK (0-15s) -> CONTEXT (15-40s)
CHAPTER 1..n: point, proof, visual, re-hook
PAYOFF -> NEXT STEP -> ONE CTA
```

