## 8. Upload and schedule

1. Create > Upload; upload a few hours early so HD processing finishes.
2. Details: title, description, thumbnail, playlist, audience, disclosures.
3. More options: tags, language, category, comments.
4. Video elements: captions, end screen (last 5-20 s), cards.
5. Wait for copyright/monetization checks.
6. Visibility: Public, Schedule or Premiere.
7. Preview on mobile.

**When:** Studio > Analytics > Audience > "When your viewers are on YouTube"; publish 2-3 hours before peak. No data yet: test two slots for 4-6 weeks. Keep the same slot weekly.

**Pace:** months 1-3: 1 long video a week, 3-5 original Shorts; later 1-2 a week. YouTube sets no required count. Batch scripts and keep a 2-video buffer.

