## 9. CTAs, community, discovery

| Goal | Where | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Watch next | End and end screen | "To fix [problem], watch this next" |
| Subscribe | After a win | "Subscribe for the next lesson in this series" |
| Comment | After a question | "Which mistake did you make?" |
| Lead/product | Description, pinned comment | "Free checklist in the description" |

One CTA per video, always with a reason. End screen: one video plus subscribe or playlist. Group videos into keyword-named playlists, reuse thumbnail style per series, turn long videos into 3-5 original Shorts, reply in the first hour, ask one question in the pinned comment, collaborate with similar-size channels. Never buy views or subscribers.

